1
00:00:00,005 --> 00:00:02,385
It doesn’t seem much better.

2
00:00:02,385 --> 00:00:04,385
True.

3
00:00:04,385 --> 00:00:06,385
Much better.

4
00:00:08,385 --> 00:00:11,385
How did it feel? Tell us.

5
00:00:14,385 --> 00:00:15,385
Which reading was this?

6
00:00:15,385 --> 00:00:18,385
The second reading.

7
00:00:22,605 --> 00:00:26,005
It still feels a bit awkward.

8
00:00:28,385 --> 00:00:30,385
Where does that awkwardness come
from?

9
00:00:30,385 --> 00:00:35,385
The text? Or your relationship to
the text?

10
00:00:36,385 --> 00:00:43,385
What do you think?

11
00:00:43,385 --> 00:00:45,385
About what?

12
00:00:45,385 --> 00:00:48,385
How was his reading? You’re the
director.

13
00:00:48,385 --> 00:00:49,385
Pretty good.

14
00:00:49,385 --> 00:00:51,385
I thought so too.
